{"title":"Show Yourself","artist":"Frozen","sourceId":"reference:2PXm7DB2BkWqPSffKRUd","sourceHash":"68ab8c0dc324741a17b3c64e7f089e3ec833ea2f16cefc9ed4ca15411ae2d178","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":11.26,"end":14.26,"text":"Every inch of me is trembling","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":14.47,"end":17.47,"text":"But not from the cold","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":19.76,"end":22.22,"text":"Something is familiar","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":22.22,"end":25.22,"text":"Like a dream, I can reach but not quite hold","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":27.31,"end":30.31,"text":"I can sense you there","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":30.45,"end":33.45,"text":"Like a friend I've always known","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":35.24,"end":38.24,"text":"I'm arriving","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":38.48,"end":41.48,"text":"And it feels like I am home","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":43.35,"end":46.35,"text":"I have always been a fortress","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":47.19,"end":50.19,"text":"Cold secrets deep inside","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":51.92,"end":54.92,"text":"You have secrets, too","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":55.38,"end":58.38,"text":"But you don't have to hide","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":59.63,"end":62.38,"text":"Show yourself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":62.38,"end":65.38,"text":"I'm dying to meet you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":65.65,"end":68.53,"text":"Show yourself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":68.53,"end":71.53,"text":"It's your turn","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":71.77,"end":74.77,"text":"Are you the one I've been looking for","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":74.98,"end":77.98,"text":"All of my life?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":79.65,"end":82.65,"text":"Show yourself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":82.86,"end":85.86,"text":"I'm ready to learn","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":86.36,"end":89.36,"text":"Ah-ah, ah-ah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":90.15,"end":93.15,"text":"Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":93.25999999999999,"end":95.82,"text":"I've never felt so certain","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":95.82,"end":98.82,"text":"All my life, I've been torn","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":100.99000000000001,"end":103.72999999999999,"text":"But I'm here for a reason","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":103.72999999999999,"end":106.72999999999999,"text":"Could it be the reason I was born?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":108.35,"end":111.35,"text":"I have always been so different","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":112.03999999999999,"end":115.03999999999999,"text":"Normal rules did not apply","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":116.28,"end":118.22999999999999,"text":"Is this the day?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":118.22999999999999,"end":120.02,"text":"Are you the way","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":120.02,"end":123.02,"text":"I finally find out why?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":124.14,"end":126.3,"text":"Show yourself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":126.3,"end":129.3,"text":"I'm no longer trembling","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":129.98,"end":132.07,"text":"Here I am","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":132.07,"end":135.07,"text":"I've come so far","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":135.93,"end":138.63,"text":"You are the answer I've waited for","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":138.63,"end":141.63,"text":"All of my life","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":142.43,"end":145.43,"text":"Oh, show yourself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":145.81,"end":148.81,"text":"Let me see who you are","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":150.99,"end":153.99,"text":"Come to me now","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":154.81,"end":157.81,"text":"Open your door","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":158.53,"end":161.53,"text":"Don't make me wait","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":162.67000000000002,"end":165.67000000000002,"text":"One moment more","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":165.75,"end":168.75,"text":"Oh, come to me now","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":170.42000000000002,"end":173.42000000000002,"text":"Open your door","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":174.12,"end":177.12,"text":"Don't make me wait","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":178.07999999999998,"end":181.07999999999998,"text":"One moment more","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":188.69,"end":191.69,"text":"Where the North wind meets the sea","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":194.2,"end":196.32999999999998,"text":"Ah-ah, ah-ah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":196.32999999999998,"end":197.66,"text":"There's a river","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":197.66,"end":199.76,"text":"Ah-ah, ah-ah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":199.76,"end":202.76,"text":"Full of memory (memories, memories)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":203.49,"end":206.49,"text":"Come, my darling, homeward bound","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":208.92000000000002,"end":211.92000000000002,"text":"I am found","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":213.78,"end":216.18,"text":"Show yourself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":216.18,"end":219.18,"text":"Step into the power","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":219.56,"end":222.03,"text":"Grow yourself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":222.03,"end":225.03,"text":"Into something new","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":225.43,"end":228.24,"text":"You are the one you've been waiting for","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":228.24,"end":230.07,"text":"All of my life","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":230.07,"end":232.15,"text":"All of your life","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":232.15,"end":235.15,"text":"Oh, show yourself","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":237.39,"end":240.39,"text":"Ah-ah, ah-ah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":241.28,"end":244.28,"text":"Ah-ah, ah-ah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":246.33,"end":249.33,"text":"Ah-ah, ah-ah","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}